                    <tr>
                      <td align="left" style="font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;word-break:break-word;">
                        <div style="font-family:Ubuntu, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;text-align:left;color:#000000;">Free pickup services are often fully booked, and we know waiting with no reply is frustrating. If you haven't heard from anyone yet, {{#if single_partner}}our priority pickup partner in your area can help.{{else}}our priority pickup partners in your area can help.{{/if}}</div>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td align="left" style="font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;word-break:break-word;">
                        <div style="font-family:Ubuntu, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;text-align:left;color:#000000;">{{#if single_partner}}<strong>{{partner_name}}</strong> is a fee-based service that usually responds quickly and takes almost anything, including items charities can't accept.{{else}}These partners are fee-based services that usually respond quickly and take almost anything, including items charities can't accept.{{/if}} If you choose this option, we'll send them the details you already gave us, so you don't need to fill out the form again. They'll contact you to confirm pricing and a pickup time.</div>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                  </tbody>
                </table>
